 "remarks": "Welcome to 75 Carriage, a classic oversized 4- to 5-bedroom Colonial on a sought-after street, just three miles from town and a short walk or bike ride to famous Kent Pond. Enjoy summer days fishing, winter skating, and the swans' annual return, a cherished neighborhood tradition. Set atop one of Wilton's highest peaks, this home offers exceptional privacy on two mature, professionally landscaped acres. Beautiful stonework and a custom oversized outdoor fireplace with a built-in grill create an ideal setting for al fresco dining. Inside, a generously sized gourmet open-concept kitchen features stone countertops, a Wolf range, and a Sub-Zero refrigerator/freezer. Floor-to-ceiling windows fill a light, airy sunroom, while a fireplace keeps the family room just off the kitchen cozy. Steps from the heated garage, a spacious mudroom features radiant-heated floors to keep your toes warm. Above, an expansive private great room features a cathedral ceiling, exposed wooden beams, a fourth fireplace with beautiful stonework, and a wet bar. Upstairs, five bedrooms include three with en suite baths for added privacy; two have oversized soaking tubs for comfort. The primary suite also boasts a radiant-heated bathroom floor, a steam shower, and a walk-in closet. A finished basement with a built-in bar, full bathroom, and sauna completes this home. Room to host. Room to play. A quiet, low-traffic neighborhood to call home.",
